			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>Sets all four contrast settings below at once. Current is what the app has always drawn. Accessible is 3:1 against the page, the WCAG 1.4.11 figure for a control with no label — this pad has none. Transparent draws nothing at all: the controls still work, they are simply not visible.

Choose Custom to use the four settings below instead; they keep whatever you last set, so a detour through a preset loses nothing.</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Button Pad</string>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
		</dict>
